  "README.md": "# fixture

> A fixture project.

## Develop

\`\`\`sh
uv sync --all-extras        # or: pip install -e ".[dev]"
uv run pytest
uv run ruff check .
uv run mypy
\`\`\`

## Run

A FastAPI HTTP service on uvicorn. It serves \`/\` and a \`/healthz\` liveness probe,
and binds \`$PORT\` (default 8000).

\`\`\`sh
uv run python -m fixture   # then: curl localhost:8000/healthz

# container
docker build -t fixture . && docker run --rm -p 8000:8000 fixture
\`\`\`

Set \`PORT\` to change the listen port.
